# Declare files that always have LF line endings on checkout
* text eol=lf
# Denote all files that are truly binary and should not be modified
*.bin binary
*.bmp binary
*.ttf binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
# 设备树源码按文本比对与合并：用户级 attributes 可能把 *.dts 标成 binary（如影音扩展名表），diff、format-patch 与合并都会坏；上面的 * text eol=lf 已管换行，这里只补 diff 与 merge
*.dts diff merge
